    `the person is the husband or wife of a party to the suit` IS FALSE
    `the person is the husband or wife of a person under criminal trial` IS FALSE
    `the person is the accused` IS FALSE
    `the evidence is on behalf of the accused or a person jointly charged with the accused` IS FALSE

