`s124(3)(a) child abuse offence against a person under 16` MEANS `Specified Offence Facts` WITH
    `the offence is a child abuse offence` IS TRUE
    `the offence is a sexual offence` IS FALSE
    `the offence is an offence under Chapter 16 of the Penal Code 1871 other than a sexual offence` IS FALSE
    `the offence was committed against a person below 16 years of age` IS TRUE
    `the offence was committed against a domestic worker by an employer of the domestic worker, a member of the employer's household or an employment agent of the domestic worker` IS FALSE
    `the offence was committed against a vulnerable person by a person who has the custody, charge or care of the vulnerable person` IS FALSE
    `the offence is an abetment of, a conspiracy to commit or an attempt to commit an offence mentioned in paragraphs (a) to (d) of the definition` IS FALSE

