#ASSERT `the advocate or solicitor is not permitted to disclose under section 128` `s128 ill a a client says he committed forgery and wants a defence`

#ASSERT `the advocate or solicitor is not permitted to disclose under section 128` `s128 advice given`

#ASSERT `the advocate or solicitor is not permitted to disclose under section 128` `s128 a document known in the course of the employment`

#ASSERT NOT `the advocate or solicitor is not permitted to disclose under section 128` `s128 ill b a communication in furtherance of a criminal purpose`

#ASSERT NOT `the advocate or solicitor is not permitted to disclose under section 128` `s128 ill c a fact observed showing fraud since the employment began`

#ASSERT NOT `the advocate or solicitor is not permitted to disclose under section 128` `s128 with the client's consent`

#ASSERT NOT `the advocate or solicitor is not permitted to disclose under section 128` `s128 no communication in the employment`

